# Trivy misconfiguration checks that do not apply to this project.
# Every other finding, at any severity, still reaches GitHub code scanning.

# Images are hosted on GHCR, so the "use only Azure / GCR / ECR registries" checks can never pass.
AVD-KSV-0032
AVD-KSV-0033
AVD-KSV-0035
# No trusted-registry allowlist policy is configured for the cluster, so this check has nothing to compare against.
AVD-KSV-0125
# The base manifests leave out metadata.namespace on purpose; Kustomize sets namespace: shopsphere for every overlay.
AVD-KSV-0110
